    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="grid" style="margin: 0;">
                <tr id="comment-header-443880"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="557058:8fab0584-c9a9-4550-ad49-dac6c71db05e"
                id="word_commented_557058:8fab0584-c9a9-4550-ad49-dac6c71db05e"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A8fab0584-c9a9-4550-ad49-dac6c71db05e">
                    孟佩
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">12/三月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-443880"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL241752https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL241752at12%2FMar%2F2512%3A43PM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-41752" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-41752</a> at 12/Mar/25 12:43 PM</h5>

<ol>
	<li>看了一下客户虚机dhclient -6 ens3 获取的地ip地址前缀是 /128的， ip -6 r 查看路由信息没有前缀，所以ping不通网关。<br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/345057" alt="da7d015a0808452d6bf864a84caf180-20250312-043711.png" height="184" width="910" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></li>
</ol>


<ol>
	<li>手动把ipv6的地址，前缀和网关配置到 ifcfg-ens3里面，目前正常了。<br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/345058" alt="e8cfd66db4f65a4d05e41fa1d21ea8f-20250312-043823.png" height="115" width="550" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></li>
</ol>


<ol>
	<li>客户咨询 ipv6能否实现 自动配置 ？<br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/345059" alt="image-20250312-044012.png" height="257" width="675" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></li>
</ol>


<ol>
	<li>另外我在测试环境测了一下，ipv6子网设置为  fd1f:8e62:3182:608c::/112 ,分别创建2台虚机，centos7和centos8，结果centos7获取的前缀是 /64的，centos8获取的前缀是 /128的。 无法获取正确的前缀 /112 。<br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/345060" alt="image-20250312-044239.png" height="376" width="850" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span><br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/345061" alt="image-20250312-044310.png" height="345" width="854" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></li>
</ol>

        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-443881"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="557058:8fab0584-c9a9-4550-ad49-dac6c71db05e"
                id="word_commented_557058:8fab0584-c9a9-4550-ad49-dac6c71db05e"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A8fab0584-c9a9-4550-ad49-dac6c71db05e">
                    孟佩
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">12/三月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-443881"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL241752https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL241752at12%2FMar%2F251%3A08PM%2Clasteditedby%E5%AD%9F%E4%BD%A9https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fpeople%2F557058%3A8fab0584c9a94550ad49dac6c71db05eat12%2FMar%2F251%3A11PM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-41752" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-41752</a> at 12/Mar/25 1:08 PM, last edited by <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/people/557058:8fab0584-c9a9-4550-ad49-dac6c71db05e" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">孟佩</a> at 12/Mar/25 1:11 PM</h5>

<p>另外客户反馈华为云可以正常dhcp可以正常获取地址，请L3 帮忙看看，为什么虚机无法获取正确的 ipv6前缀。</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/345062" alt="image-20250312-051106.png" height="83" width="480" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-443912"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="6018eef44e258e00694e3eb3"
                id="word_commented_6018eef44e258e00694e3eb3"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6018eef44e258e00694e3eb3">
                    王维甲
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">12/三月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-443912"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>1.dhcpv6和dhcpv4寻址机制不同，ipv6的前缀需要下发RA包配置，而下发RA包的条件就是要设置子网网关（设置ipv6子网ipv6-ra-mode为dhcpv6-stateful，并绑定到router，新版的proton6.5.1会默认设置）。</p>

<p>2.之前处理过这个问题：</p>

<p><a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/EAS-61160" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/EAS-61160</a> </p>

<p><a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/EAS-81850" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/EAS-81850</a> </p>

<p>3.在proton6.5.1环境测试，可以成功获取到ipv6前缀：</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/345109" alt="image-20250312-081158.png" height="349" width="853" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

